@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy — TippSend";
}

@section Styles {
<style>
body { background: var(--gs-cream); }
.privacy-hero {
    background: var(--gs-bog-deep);
    padding: 64px 0 48px;
}
.privacy-body {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 80px;
}
.privacy-body h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gs-bog-deep);
    margin: 40px 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}
.privacy-body h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.privacy-body p, .privacy-body li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--gs-stone);
}
.privacy-body ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
}
.privacy-body a { color: var(--gs-gold-deep); }
.privacy-updated {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gs-fog);
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gs-mist);
}
</style>
}

<div class="privacy-hero">
    <div class="container-xl">
        <div class="eyebrow mb-2" style="color:var(--gs-gold-soft)">Legal</div>
        <h1 style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px);color:var(--gs-cream);letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin:0">
            Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p style="color:var(--gs-fog);font-size:15px;margin-top:12px;max-width:560px">
            We keep this short and plain. Here's exactly what we collect, why, and what we do with it.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container-xl">
    <div class="privacy-body">

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
            TippSend is a local delivery service operating in South Tipperary, Ireland. Our contact email is
            <a href="mailto:hello@tippsend.ie">hello@tippsend.ie</a>. When we say "we", "us", or "TippSend",
            we mean the person running this service.
        </p>

        <h2>What personal data we collect</h2>
        <p>When you place an order or make a booking, we collect:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your name, email address, and phone number</li>
            <li>The recipient's name, phone number, and delivery address</li>
            <li>Your pickup or delivery address</li>
            <li>Any special instructions you provide</li>
            <li>Your order details (item description, preferred date and time, price paid)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            We do <strong>not</strong> collect or store your payment card details. All payments are processed
            securely by <a href="https://stripe.com/ie/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Stripe</a>,
            which has its own privacy policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>
            We need this information to fulfil the delivery you've paid for — to collect your item, deliver it
            to the right person, and contact you if something comes up. The legal basis under GDPR is
            <strong>contract performance</strong> (Article 6(1)(b)): we can't do the job without it.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>To carry out your delivery and contact you or the recipient about it</li>
            <li>To send you a booking confirmation email</li>
            <li>To send status updates (collected, out for delivery, delivered)</li>
            <li>To resolve disputes or answer questions about your order</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not use your data for marketing, and we do not sell or share it with third parties for any commercial purpose.</p>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>Your data is shared only with services that are essential to running TippSend:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payment processing (they receive your email address at checkout)</li>
            <li><strong>Microsoft Azure</strong> — our hosting provider, which stores the database containing your order records</li>
            <li><strong>SendGrid / our email provider</strong> — used to send you confirmation and status emails</li>
        </ul>
        <p>All of these providers are GDPR-compliant and process data only as necessary to provide their service to us.</p>

        <h2>How long we keep your data</h2>
        <p>
            We keep order records for <strong>2 years</strong> from the date of delivery. After that, personal
            details (name, email, phone, address) are deleted. We may retain non-personal summary data
            (order count, revenue totals) for longer for business purposes.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>Under GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Access</strong> — ask us what personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li><strong>Correction</strong> — ask us to correct inaccurate data</li>
            <li><strong>Erasure</strong> — ask us to delete your personal data ("right to be forgotten")</li>
            <li><strong>Restriction</strong> — ask us to stop processing your data in certain circumstances</li>
            <li><strong>Portability</strong> — request a copy of your data in a readable format</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            To exercise any of these rights, email us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@tippsend.ie">hello@tippsend.ie</a>. We will respond within 30 days.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            TippSend uses only essential cookies — for login sessions and form security (CSRF protection).
            We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or analytics services that identify you
            personally. No cookie consent banner is required.
        </p>

        <h2>Data security</h2>
        <p>
            Your data is stored in a secured Microsoft Azure SQL database with access restricted to
            the TippSend operator. All data is transmitted over HTTPS. We take reasonable steps to protect
            your information, but no system is completely foolproof.
        </p>

        <h2>Data breaches</h2>
        <p>
            In the unlikely event of a data breach affecting your personal data, we will notify the Irish
            Data Protection Commission (DPC) within 72 hours as required by GDPR, and notify affected
            individuals where appropriate.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact &amp; complaints</h2>
        <p>
            If you have any question about how we handle your data, email us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@tippsend.ie">hello@tippsend.ie</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you are not satisfied with our response, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the
            <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ie" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Data Protection Commission (DPC)</a>,
            the supervisory authority for data protection in Ireland.
        </p>

        <p class="privacy-updated">Last updated: May 2026</p>

    </div>
</div>
